    div(style='padding-top: 70px')
      if callflowPending
        #callflow-resume-bar.alert.alert-info.alert-dismissible.fade.show.text-center.mb-0(role='alert' style='border-radius:0')
          | Welcome back!
          a.alert-link.ms-2(href='/callflow') See what's new
